Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_08h.avi - Approaching the Ragnarok
Duration: approximately 4 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A close-up view of the Ragnarok's exterior as Squall and Rinoa approach. The red spacecraft is sleek and formidable, with sharp, swept-back wings that give it a dragon-like silhouette. Details of the hull become visible — panel lines, viewport windows, and engine housings. The ship fills more of the frame as they draw near to its docking port or airlock.
